WEBVTT

00:02:55.504 --> 00:03:02.261
It's, like all evolutionary mechanisms,
powered by mutations.

00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:06.766
And in this case, what the mutations are

00:03:06.766 --> 00:03:11.771
are very weird people trying new stuff.

00:03:11.812 --> 00:03:16.150
And when we need
really big progress, big new stuff,

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:19.779
that means we need
really, really weird people.

00:03:20.238 --> 00:03:23.783
Elon, looking at you, buddy.
I don't know where you are today.

00:03:23.783 --> 00:03:25.284
(Laughter)

00:03:25.326 --> 00:03:30.414
Prior to the rise of modern capitalism,
it absolutely sucked to be weird.